div></div></header><main id="main"><section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-[100svh] items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#ad1428] pt-[76px] text-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-[80vh] w-[70vw] opacity-70" style="background:radial-gradient(65% 65% at 76% 34%, rgba(220,93,57,0.42) 0%, rgba(173,20,40,0) 72%)"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0" style="background:linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(80,7,23,0.22) 0%, rgba(123,10,30,0.08) 42%, rgba(195,15,35,0) 72%)"></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="1.6" class="font-display pointer-events-none absolute right-[2vw] top-1/2 z-0 -translate-y-1/2 select-none text-[34vw] font-semibold uppercase leading-none tracking-tighter" style="color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(255,255,255,0.10)">Lishin</span><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-[76px] z-20"><div class="container-x flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/15 py-4 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/70"><span class="font-display">Chen Li-Shin — 2026</span><span class="hidden font-display sm:block">獨立參選 · 為城市做事 · Independent</span></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 right-[-3%] z-10 h-[94%] w-[62%] sm:right-[0%] sm:w-[52%] lg:w-[46%]"><img alt="" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="hero-figure object-contain object-bottom" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent;filter:drop-shadow(-18px 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35))" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 60vw, 46vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F2c6979a93482834735a22373b955e939255e2e94-889x1500.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-[15] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ad1428] from-25% via-[#ad1428]/60 via-70% to-transparent sm:hidden"></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-text absolute left-6 top-1/2 z-20 hidden -translate-y-1/2 select-none text-xs font-medium text-white/40 xl:block">城市需要新力量・二〇二六</span><div class="container-x relative z-20 w-full"><div class="max-w-2xl"><div class="hero-in flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-black/5 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white/78 backdrop-blur-sm sm:text-sm"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f0d6a5]"></span>2026 台北第五選區｜中正・萬華 市議員候選人</span><a href="#vote" data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="hero_countdown" data-ga-label="countdown" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#f0d6a5]/70 bg-[#f0d6a5] px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#651524] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 sm:text-sm"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-[#8e1a2c]"></span>11/28（六）投票</a></div><h1 class="mt-5 font-black tracking-tight"><span class="sr-only">陳力新 — 2026 台北第五選區中正・萬華市議員候選人</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="block overflow-hidden"><span class="hero-line pb-[0.06em] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,2.9rem)] font-medium tracking-[0.05em] text-[#f4e6d2]/90">城市需要</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="block overflow-hidden"><span class="hero-line flex items-end pb-[0.08em] text-[clamp(4.2rem,12vw,9.5rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.03em]"><span class="text-[#f0d6a5]">新力量</span><span class="ml-1 self-start text-white">！</span></span></span></h1><p class="hero-in max-w-md text-base mt-6 leading-relaxed text-white/78">陳力新，土生土長的萬華囝仔，2026投入台北第五選區中正・萬華市議員選舉。帶著國際經驗回家，無黨無派，只為這座城市做事。</p><p class="hero-in mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-sm font-medium text-[#f0d6a5]/86"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">無黨無派</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-white/22">·</span>不收政治獻金</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-white/22">·</span>萬華土生土長</span></p><div class="hero-in flex mt-6 items-center gap-4"><span class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-[0.2em] sm:text-3xl">陳力新</span><span class="w-px h-6 bg-[#f0d6a5]/45"></span><span class="text-sm text-white/68 font-medium">無黨籍・第五選舉區</span></div><div class="hero-in flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-8"><a href="/#join" data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="hero" data-ga-label="加入志工" data-magnetic="true" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#f6ead8] px-7 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-[#86182a] shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(66,6,18,0.18)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white">加入志工<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><a href="/about" class="link-sweep inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-1 py-2 text-base text-white/76 hover:text-white font-medium">認識我</a></div></div></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-20 hidden lg:block"><div class="container-x flex items-center justify-between py-5 font-display text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/45"><span>中正 · 萬華　Taipei City Council</span><span>No.<span class="text-white/70">2026</span></span></div></div><a href="#message" class="group absolute bottom-16 left-1/2 z-20 hidden -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-1 text-white/60 transition-colors hover:text-white lg:flex"><span class="font-display text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em]">Scroll</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 animate-bounce"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></a></section><div class="relative flex w-full overflow-hidden border-y py-5" style="background:var(--brand);border-color:transparent"><div class="marquee-track" data-marquee="true" data-marquee-dir="1" style="animation:marquee 34s linear infinite"><span class="flex items-center" style="color:#fff"><span class="font-display whitespace-nowrap px-6 text-lg font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide sm:text-2xl">城市需要新力量</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" style="color:var(--accent)"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center" style="color:#fff"><span class="font-display whitespace-nowrap px-6 text-lg fon