"true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">About</span><h2 data-split="true" class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-xl font-bold leading-snug sm:text-2xl" style="color:var(--ink)">在地的根，國際的眼界</h2></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-[1.9] text-ink-soft sm:text-lg">從萬華出發，走向世界，再帶著經驗回家。陳力新投入2026台北第五選區市議員選舉，希望把在地經驗與國際視野帶進中正萬華。</p></div><div class="reveal "><ul class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>萬華在地囝仔</li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>留美・留日</li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>國際企業負責人</li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 w-3 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>無黨無派・乾淨參政</li></ul></div></div><div data-parallax="0.6" class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[440px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 right-8 top-8 rounded-[20px] bg-brand-soft"></div><div class="img-reveal relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] shadow-2xl"><img alt="陳力新穿深色西裝的肖像" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1250" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover object-top" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 488px) calc(100vw - 48px), 440px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F512f3b2bfc34d8400d2937773d000160a5332b68-1000x1500.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div><div class="reveal "><h2 class="mt-20 flex items-end gap-4 border-t border-line pt-10"><span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-brand sm:text-3xl">Career &amp; Education</span><span class="mb-1 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-soft">學經歷</span></h2></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="reveal "><article class="group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-none text-brand/10">01</span><span class="block h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand"></span><p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-brand">在地</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink">萬華囝仔</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">萬華國中畢業，在艋舺的街巷裡長大，最懂這片土地的脈動與需要。</p></article></div><div class="reveal "><article class="group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-none text-brand/10">02</span><span class="block h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand"></span><p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-brand">國際</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink">留美・留日</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">赴美國與日本求學、歷練，培養國際視野與跨文化的解題能力。</p></article></div><div class="reveal "><article class="group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-none text-brand/10">03</span><span class="block h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand"></span><p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-brand">創業</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink">國際企業負責人</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">投身海外青年創業，擔任國際企業負責人，把世界的經驗帶回台北。</p></article></div><div class="reveal "><article class="group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-3 font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-none text-brand/10">04</span><span class="block h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-brand"></span><p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-brand">進修</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-ink">政大 EMBA 碩士</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">國立政治大學 EMBA 碩士；台大 E 勢泮後 EMBA 結業，持續精進治理與管理。</p></article></div></div></div></section><section aria-label="剝皮寮歷史街區的清晨" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink"><div aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="0.5" class="absolute -inset-y-[8%] inset-x-0"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="duotone object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:72% 50%;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ff70725f621022d70ea257076a195490cd1ee99ff-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/60 via-transparent to-ink/10"></div><div class="container-x relative flex h-[46vh] min-h-[340px] items-end justify-between pb-8 sm:h-[56vh] sm:pb-10"><span data-drift="true" class="font-display block max-w-[80%] text-[clamp(2.2rem,7vw,5rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white/90">Bangka, where Taipei began</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-text hidden max-h-[60%] select-none self-start pt-2 text-xs font-bold text-white/85 sm:block">艋舺・剝皮寮・清晨</span></div></section><section id="vision" class="section-y bg-cream"><div class="container-x"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-end"><div class=""><div class="reveal "><div class="flex items-center gap-3 "><span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45" style="background:var(--brand)"></span><span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:var(--brand)">願景</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-drift="true" data-split="true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">Vision</span><h2 data-split="true" class="font-serif-tc mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.4rem)] font-black leading-[1.35]" style="color:var(--ink)">把萬華的老底蘊，接上面向世界的新力量</h2></div><div class="reveal "><p class="font-serif-tc text-base font-semibold leading-[2.05] text-ink/80 sm:text-lg">我在萬華長大，也曾在美國、日本求學與工作。這次投入台北第五選區中正萬華市議員選舉，我希望把國際的眼界帶回家鄉，用科技與新的治理方式改善老城區生活，讓中正萬華不只是被懷念的過去，更成為被期待的未來。</p></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6"><div class="reveal "><div class="relative border-t-2 border-brand/15 pt-6"><span class="font-display block text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-brand/20">01</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-ink">用科技，讓老城區重新呼吸</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">把 AI 與數位工具帶進地方治理，從停車、長照到觀光導覽逐項盤點在地需求，讓萬華老街區保有濃濃人情味，也能更聰明、更便利地運作。</p></div></div><div class="reveal "><div class="relative border-t-2 border-brand/15 pt-6"><span class="font-display block text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-brand/20">02</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-ink">讓長輩安心、年輕人願意留下</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">宜居不是口號，而是每天的生活細節。推動更友善的步行環境、社區照顧與公共空間，讓長輩在熟悉的巷弄裡安心生活，也讓年輕世代願意把根留在萬華、留在中正。</p></div></div><div class="reveal "><div class="relative border-t-2 border-brand/15 pt-6"><span class="font-display block text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-brand/20">03</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-ink">把世界帶進來，把萬華帶出去</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">我曾在海外創業、經營國際企業，深知連結的價值。推動在地與國際接軌，讓萬華的文化、店家與青年被更多人看見，也讓世界的好經驗在這片土地上慢慢落地。</p></div></div></div><div class="reveal "><p class="font-serif-tc mt-16 flex items-start gap-3 text-2xl font-black leading-snug text-brand sm:text-3xl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1.5 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg><span>城市需要新力量，而這股新力量，就從萬華這片我們共同的土地開始。</span></p></div></div></section><section id="ideas" class="section-y bg-white"><div class="container-x"><div class=""><div class="reveal "><div class="flex items-center gap-3 "><span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45" style="background:var(--brand)"></span><span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:var(--brand)">想法</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-drift="true" data-split="true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">Ideas</span><h2 data-split="true" class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-xl font-bold leading-snug sm:text-2xl" style="color:var(--ink)">關於萬華，我是這樣想的</h2></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft sm:text-base">這些不是漂亮的口號，是我平常真正在想、也想當面跟你說的話。</p></div><div class="mt-12 gap-5 sm:columns-2 lg:columns-3 [&amp;&gt;*]:mb-5 [&amp;&gt;*]:break-inside-avoid"><div class="reveal "><article class="rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><header class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-white"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M16.7 11.2c-.1 0-.2-.1-.3-.1-.2-3-1.8-4.7-4.5-4.7-1.6 0-3 .7-3.8 2l1.5 1c.6-.9 1.5-1.1 2.3-1.1 1.3 0 2.3.8 2.5 2.3-.7-.2-1.4-.3-2.2-.2-2.3.1-3.8 1.5-3.7 3.4.1 1.7 1.6 2.8 3.4 2.7 1.4-.1 2.5-.7 3.2-1.8.5-.8.7-1.7.8-2.7.7.4 1.2 1 1.5 1.7.5 1.2.5 3.1-1 4.7-1.3 1.4-2.9 2-5.1 2-2.4 0-4.3-.8-5.5-2.3C6.2 17.4 5.6 15.4 5.5 13c.1-2.4.7-4.4 1.8-5.8C8.5 5.6 10.4 4.8 12.8 4.8c2.4 0 4.3.8 5.6 2.4.6.8 1.1 1.7 1.4 2.8l1.7-.5c-.3-1.4-.9-2.6-1.8-3.6C18 3.9 15.6 2.9 12.8 2.9h-.1C9.5 2.9 7 4 5.3 6.1 3.8 8 3 10.4 3 13.3v.1c0 2.9.8 5.3 2.3 7.1C7 21.8 9.5 22.9 12.7 23h.1c2.6 0 4.7-.7 6.4-2.5 2.2-2.3 2.1-5.2 1.4-6.9-.6-1.3-1.7-2.3-3.2-3 0-.1-.5-.3-.7-.4Zm-4.4 5.2c-1 .1-2-.4-2.1-1.2-.1-.6.4-1.4 2-1.5h.6c.6 0 1.1.1 1.6.2-.2 1.6-1 2.4-2.1 2.5Z"></path></svg></span><div class="leading-tight"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">陳力新</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-soft">@chen._.lishin</p></div><span class="font-display ml-auto rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide text-brand">科技萬華</span></header><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">我在國外看過不少城市，用科技把老問題一個個解開。萬華不是舊，它只是還沒被好好升級。我想試著把 AI 和數位工具帶進地方治理，讓老城區也能更聰明、更方便，這是我最想做的方向。</p></article></div><div class="reveal "><article class="rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><header class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-white"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M16.7 11.2c-.1 0-.2-.1-.3-.1-.2-3-1.8-4.7-4.5-4.7-1.6 0-3 .7-3.8 2l1.5 1c.6-.9 1.5-1.1 2.3-1.1 1.3 0 2.3.8 2.5 2.3-.7-.2-1.4-.3-2.2-.2-2.3.1-3.8 1.5-3.7 3.4.1 1.7 1.6 2.8 3.4 2.7 1.4-.1 2.5-.7 3.2-1.8.5-.8.7-1.7.8-2.7.7.4 1.2 1 1.5 1.7.5 1.2.5 3.1-1 4.7-1.3 1.4-2.9 2-5.1 2-2.4 0-4.3-.8-5.5-2.3C6.2 17.4 5.6 15.4 5.5 13c.1-2.4.7-4.4 1.8-5.8C8.5 5.6 10.4 4.8 12.8 4.8c2.4 0 4.3.8 5.6 2.4.6.8 1.1 1.7 1.4 2.8l1.7-.5c-.3-1.4-.9-2.6-1.8-3.6C18 3.9 15.6 2.9 12.8 2.9h-.1C9.5 2.9 7 4 5.3 6.1 3.8 8 3 10.4 3 13.3v.1c0 2.9.8 5.3 2.3 7.1C7 21.8 9.5 22.9 12.7 23h.1c2.6 0 4.7-.7 6.4-2.5 2.2-2.3 2.1-5.2 1.4-6.9-.6-1.3-1.7-2.3-3.2-3 0-.1-.5-.3-.7-.4Zm-4.4 5.2c-1 .1-2-.4-2.1-1.2-.1-.6.4-1.4 2-1.5h.6c.6 0 1.1.1 1.6.2-.2 1.6-1 2.4-2.1 2.5Z"></path></svg></span><div class="leading-tight"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">陳力新</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-soft">@chen._.lishin</p></div><span class="font-display ml-auto rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide text-brand">拒收獻金</span></header><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">我選擇不收政治獻金，因為我想欠的是鄉親的信任，不是任何人的人情。也提醒大家：如果有人用我的名義對外募款，一律是詐騙，請務必小心，別讓壞人有機可乘。</p></article></div><div class="reveal "><article class="rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><header class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-white"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M16.7 11.2c-.1 0-.2-.1-.3-.1-.2-3-1.8-4.7-4.5-4.7-1.6 0-3 .7-3.8 2l1.5 1c.6-.9 1.5-1.1 2.3-1.1 1.3 0 2.3.8 2.5 2.3-.7-.2-1.4-.3-2.2-.2-2.3.1-3.8 1.5-3.7 3.4.1 1.7 1.6 2.8 3.4 2.7 1.4-.1 2.5-.7 3.2-1.8.5-.8.7-1.7.8-2.7.7.4 1.2 1 1.5 1.7.5 1.2.5 3.1-1 4.7-1.3 1.4-2.9 2-5.1 2-2.4 0-4.3-.8-5.5-2.3C6.2 17.4 5.6 15.4 5.5 13c.1-2.4.7-4.4 1.8-5.8C8.5 5.6 10.4 4.8 12.8 4.8c2.4 0 4.3.8 5.6 2.4.6.8 1.1 1.7 1.4 2.8l1.7-.5c-.3-1.4-.9-2.6-1.8-3.6C18 3.9 15.6 2.9 12.8 2.9h-.1C9.5 2.9 7 4 5.3 6.1 3.8 8 3 10.4 3 13.3v.1c0 2.9.8 5.3 2.3 7.1C7 21.8 9.5 22.9 12.7 23h.1c2.6 0 4.7-.7 6.4-2.5 2.2-2.3 2.1-5.2 1.4-6.9-.6-1.3-1.7-2.3-3.2-3 0-.1-.5-.3-.7-.4Zm-4.4 5.2c-1 .1-2-.4-2.1-1.2-.1-.6.4-1.4 2-1.5h.6c.6 0 1.1.1 1.6.2-.2 1.6-1 2.4-2.1 2.5Z"></path></svg></span><div class="leading-tight"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">陳力新</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-soft">@chen._.lishin</p></div><span class="font-display ml-auto rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide text-brand">國際視野</span></header><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">我在美國、在日本念過書、做過事，但我始終記得自己是萬華長大的孩子。把在國外學到、看到的好東西帶回家鄉，讓熟悉的老地方也能接上新世界，是我一直放在心上的事。</p></article></div><div class="reveal "><article class="rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><header class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand text-white"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M16.7 11.2c-.1 0-.2-.1-.3-.1-.2-3-1.8-4.7-4.5-4.7-1.6 0-3 .7-3.8 2l1.5 1c.6-.9 1.5-1.1 2.3-1.1 1.3 0 2.3.8 2.5 2.3-.7-.2-1.4-.3-2.2-.2-2.3.1-3.8 1.5-3.7 3.4.1 1.7 1.6 2.8 3.4 2.7 1.4-.1 2.5-.7 3.2-1.8.5-.8.7-1.7.8-2.7.7.4 1.2 1 1.5 1.7.5 1.2.5 3.1-1 4.7-1.3 1.4-2.9 2-5.1 2-2.4 0-4.3-.8-5.5-2.3C6.2 17.4 5.6 15.4 5.5 13c.1-2.4.7-4.4 1.8-5.8C8.5 5.6 10.4 4.8 12.8 4.8c2.4 0 4.3.8 5.6 2.4.6.8 1.1 1.7 1.4 2.8l1.7-.5c-.3-1.4-.9-2.6-1.8-3.6C18 3.9 15.6 2.9 12.8 2.9h-.1C9.5 2.9 7 4 5.3 6.1 3.8 8 3 10.4 3 13.3v.1c0 2.9.8 5.3 2.3 7.1C7 21.8 9.5 22.9 12.7 23h.1c2.6 0 4.7-.7 6.4-2.5 2.2-2.3 2.1-5.2 1.4-6.9-.6-1.3-1.7-2.3-3.2-3 0-.1-.5-.3-.7-.4Zm-4.4 5.2c-1 .1-2-.4-2.1-1.2-.1-.6.4-1.4 2-1.5h.6c.6 0 1.1.1 1.6.2-.2 1.6-1 2.4-2.1 2.5Z"></path></svg></span><div class="leading-tight"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">陳力新</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-soft">@chen._.lishin</p></div><span class="font-display ml-auto rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide text-brand">新力量</span></header><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink">力新，其實就是「新力量」。我沒有派系、也沒有包袱，第一次參政，反而更敢想、更願意聽、也更願意從頭學起。城市需要新力量，我想當那個願意陪萬華一起往前走的人。</p></article></div></div></div></section><section id="policy" data-hscroll="true" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream"><div class="container-x pt-[clamp(4.5rem,10vw,9rem)]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div class=""><div class="reveal "><div class="flex items-center gap-3 "><span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45" style="background:var(--brand)"></span><span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:var(--brand)">政見方向</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-drift="true" data-split="true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">Policy</span><h2 data-split="true" class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-xl font-bold leading-snug sm:text-2xl" style="color:var(--ink)">陳力新六大政見｜給中正萬華一座更好的城</h2></div><div class="reveal "><div class="lg:text-right"><p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink-soft lg:justify-end"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>政見方向以萬華中正的真實需求為本，將隨地方意見持續滾動修正。</p><p aria-hidden="true" class="font-display mt-3 hidden text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-soft/60 lg:block">Scroll<!-- --> →</p></div></div></div></div><div class="pb-[clamp(4.5rem,10vw,9rem)] pt-10 lg:pt-14"><div data-hscroll-track="true" class="flex flex-col px-[clamp(1.25rem,5vw,4rem)] lg:w-max lg:flex-row lg:flex-nowrap lg:items-stretch lg:pr-[12vw]"><a data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="policy_index" data-ga-label="科技活化・地方創生" class="group flex flex-col border-t border-ink/15 py-9 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 lg:w-[clamp(400px,36vw,540px)] lg:shrink-0 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:px-10 lg:py-6 lg:border-l-0 lg:pl-0" href="/policy/tech"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-stroke-brand text-6xl font-semibold leading-none opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 sm:text-7xl">01</span><span class="font-display rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Tech</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">科技活化・地方創生</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">用 AI 與數位工具盤點老城區的閒置空間與人流，把科技導入地方治理，讓市民服務更即時、申辦更便民，也讓艋舺的店家與人潮一起回流，老萬華長出新活力。</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">深入了解<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a><a data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="policy_index" data-ga-label="青年就業・新創扶植" class="group flex flex-col border-t border-ink/15 py-9 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 lg:w-[clamp(400px,36vw,540px)] lg:shrink-0 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:px-10 lg:py-6 " href="/policy/youth"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-stroke-brand text-6xl font-semibold leading-none opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 sm:text-7xl">02</span><span class="font-display rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Youth</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">青年就業・新創扶植</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">以海外創業者的第一手經驗，搭建青年就業與微型創業的支持網，盤點在地共創空間、媒合資源與輔導，讓年輕人願意留在萬華，在家鄉把想法做成事業。</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">深入了解<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a><a data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="policy_index" data-ga-label="國際視野・城市競爭力" class="group flex flex-col border-t border-ink/15 py-9 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 lg:w-[clamp(400px,36vw,540px)] lg:shrink-0 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:px-10 lg:py-6 " href="/policy/global"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-stroke-brand text-6xl font-semibold leading-none opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 sm:text-7xl">03</span><span class="font-display rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Global</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">國際視野・城市競爭力</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">把留美、留日與經營國際企業的歷練帶回家鄉，推動跨城市交流與國際資源連結，讓中正、萬華逐步接軌世界，提升老城區面對未來的長期競爭力。</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">深入了解<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a><a data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="policy_index" data-ga-label="廉能政治・透明問政" class="group flex flex-col border-t border-ink/15 py-9 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 lg:w-[clamp(400px,36vw,540px)] lg:shrink-0 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:px-10 lg:py-6 " href="/policy/clean"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-stroke-brand text-6xl font-semibold leading-none opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 sm:text-7xl">04</span><span class="font-display rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Clean</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">廉能政治・透明問政</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">無黨無派、不收政治獻金，也提醒鄉親：以我名義對外募款一律是詐騙。推動行程與問政資料公開、可查詢，讓每一筆預算都攤在陽光下，接受市民監督。</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">深入了解<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a><a data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="policy_index" data-ga-label="宜居社區・安全友善" class="group flex flex-col border-t border-ink/15 py-9 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 lg:w-[clamp(400px,36vw,540px)] lg:shrink-0 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:px-10 lg:py-6 " href="/policy/livable"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-stroke-brand text-6xl font-semibold leading-none opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 sm:text-7xl">05</span><span class="font-display rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Livable</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">宜居社區・安全友善</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">盤點老舊街區的人行道、路燈照明與無障礙環境，推動友善長照與托育的可近性，打造對長輩、孩子與行人都安心好走、住得安心的宜居社區。</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">深入了解<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a><a data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="policy_index" data-ga-label="觀光文化・在地經濟" class="group flex flex-col border-t border-ink/15 py-9 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 lg:w-[clamp(400px,36vw,540px)] lg:shrink-0 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:px-10 lg:py-6 " href="/policy/culture"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display text-stroke-brand text-6xl font-semibold leading-none opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 sm:text-7xl">06</span><span class="font-display rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand">Culture</span></div><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-brand">觀光文化・在地經濟</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">以艋舺的歷史、信仰與街區故事為底蘊，串連在地店家與觀光動線，推動文化結合科技的導覽體驗，帶動在地經濟，把萬華的故事好好說給世界聽。</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">深入了解<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><div class="relative flex w-full overflow-hidden border-y py-5" style="background:var(--cream);border-color:transparent"><div class="marquee-track" data-marquee="true" data-marquee-dir="-1" style="animation:marquee-rev 34s linear infinite"><span class="flex items-center" style="color:var(--ink)"><span class="font-display whitespace-nowrap px-6 text-lg font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide sm:text-2xl">城市需要新力量</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" style="color:var(--brand)"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center" style="color:var(--ink