 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">頂碩里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">日善里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">全德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">忠德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink-soft">孝德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">錦德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">和德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">銘德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">保德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink-soft">榮德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">華中里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">興德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink-soft">壽德里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink-soft">日祥里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink-soft">忠貞里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink-soft">新忠里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">新安里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">新和里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">凌霄里</li><li class="rounded-full border px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors border-brand bg-brand text-white">騰雲里</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-10 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>想邀力新到你的里走走？加入志工時留個話，或到社群私訊我們。</p></div></div></section><section id="voices" class="section-y bg-cream"><div class="container-x"><div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-16"><div><div class=""><div class="reveal "><div class="flex items-center gap-3 "><span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45" style="background:var(--brand)"></span><span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:var(--brand)">城市的心聲</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-drift="true" data-split="true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">Voices</span><h2 data-split="true" class="font-serif-tc mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.4rem)] font-black leading-[1.35]" style="color:var(--ink)">你想改變中正萬華的一件事，是什麼？</h2></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-[1.9] text-ink-soft sm:text-lg">問政的題目不該從辦公室裡想出來，而是從街上聽回來。留下你最在意的一件事——它會直接進入力新的問政筆記。</p></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-9 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-accent"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z"></path></svg>走基層時，大家最常提到的事</p></div><ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">人行道好走一點</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">巷口的路燈亮一點</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">停車不要再繞圈</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">老店有人接手</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">孩子上學的路更安全</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">長輩就近有照顧</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">垃圾與環境清潔</span></li><li class="reveal "><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink">捷運周邊的發展</span></li></ul></div><div class="reveal "><div class="rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 sm:p-8"><form class="flex flex-col gap-6" noValidate=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><label for="voice-msg" class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">你最想改變的一件事<span class="text-brand"> *</span></label><textarea id="voice-msg" required="" rows="4" maxLength="2000" placeholder="例：○○街的騎樓高低差，長輩很容易跌倒……" class="w-full rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-ink focus:border-brand outline-none resize-none leading-relaxed"></textarea></div><fieldset class="flex flex-col gap-2"><legend class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">你住在哪一區？</legend><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="voice-district" value="中正區"/>中正區</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="voice-district" value="萬華區"/>萬華區</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="voice-district" value="其他"/>其他</label></div></fieldset><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><label for="voice-contact" class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">聯絡方式（選填，方便我們回覆）</label><input id="voice-contact" type="text" maxLength="200" placeholder="LINE ID 或 Email" class="w-full rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-ink focus:border-brand outline-none" value=""/></div><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"><a class="font-bold text-brand underline underline-offset-2" href="/privacy">隱私權</a> · <!-- -->送出即表示你已閱讀隱私權告知，並同意團隊依所述目的處理這次提供的資料。</p><button type="submit" data-ga-event="voice_submitted" class="w-full rounded-[10px] bg-brand px-7 py-4 font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-deep disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60">送出，讓力新聽見</button></form></div></div></div></div></section><section aria-label="萬華夜市華燈初上" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink"><div aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="0.5" class="absolute -inset-y-[8%] inset-x-0"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="duotone object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2F8bed77cb843aea3719aef0992b50cf51a49f55c0-2048x1152.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/60 via-transparent to-ink/10"></div><div class="container-x relative flex h-[46vh] min-h-[340px] items-end justify-between pb-8 sm:h-[56vh] sm:pb-10"><span data-drift="true" class="font-display block max-w-[80%] text-[clamp(2.2rem,7vw,5rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-white/90">The night is still young</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="v-text hidden max-h-[60%] select-none self-start pt-2 text-xs font-bold text-white/85 sm:block">華燈初上・萬華夜色</span></div></section><section id="join" class="section-y relative overflow-hidden bg-cream"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-display pointer-events-none absolute -left-3 bottom-2 select-none text-[26vw] font-semibold uppercase leading-none tracking-tighter text-brand/[0.05]">Join</span><div class="container-x relative z-10"><div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr]"><div><div class=""><div class="reveal "><div class="flex items-center gap-3 "><span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45" style="background:var(--brand)"></span><span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:var(--brand)">加入我們</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-drift="true" data-split="true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">Join</span><h2 data-split="true" class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-xl font-bold leading-snug sm:text-2xl" style="color:var(--ink)">把你的力量，借給這座城市</h2></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-[1.9] text-ink-soft sm:text-lg">改變不會從天而降，它來自每一個願意站出來的人。從追蹤、分享，到加入志工——選一個你做得到的方式，一起為中正萬華注入新力量。</p></div><div class="mt-9 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="reveal "><a href="#share" data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="join_ladder" data-ga-label="追蹤 + 分享" class="group flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-brand/25">01</span><h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-ink">追蹤 + 分享</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">在 Threads、IG、YouTube 追蹤力新，把理念分享給住在中正、萬華的朋友。</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-brand">一鍵分享<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="reveal "><a href="#volunteer" data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="join_ladder" data-ga-label="加入志工" class="group flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-brand/25">02</span><h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-ink">加入志工</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">留下聯絡方式，投票日前我們會邀你一起掃街、顧攤、線上小編，做你做得到的。</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-brand">我要加入<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class="reveal "><a href="#vote" data-ga-event="cta_clicked" data-ga-location="join_ladder" data-ga-label="把消息帶回家" class="group flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/30 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-brand/25">03</span><h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-ink">把消息帶回家</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">設籍中正、萬華的鄉親，記得 11/28 返鄉投票，也提醒家人朋友一起。</p><span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-brand">看投票資訊<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="reveal "><div id="share" class="mt-10 rounded-[20px] bg-brand-soft p-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div><p class="text-base font-bold text-ink">幫力新一個忙</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">找 3 個住中正、萬華的朋友，一起認識力新。分享，是素人最珍貴的力量。</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://social-plugins.line.me/lineit/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lishin.taipei" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-ga-event="share_click" data-ga-platform="line" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand hover:text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]"><path d="M12 3C6.5 3 2 6.6 2 11c0 3.9 3.5 7.2 8.3 7.9.3.07.75.22.86.5.1.26.06.66.03.92l-.14.83c-.04.25-.2.97.85.53s5.64-3.32 7.7-5.69C20.94 14.4 22 12.8 22 11c0-4.4-4.5-8-10-8Z"></path></svg>LINE</a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lishin.taipei" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-ga-event="share_click" data-ga-platform="facebook" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand hover:text-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[18px] w-[18px]"><path d="M13.5 21v-7h2.3l.4-2.8h-2.7V9.4c0-.8.23-1.36 1.4-1.36h1.46V5.5a20 20 0 0 0-2.16-.11c-2.13 0-3.6 1.3-3.6 3.69v2.06H8.3V14h2.3v7Z"></path></svg>Facebook</a><a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%E5%9F%8E%E5%B8%82%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%96%B0%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%EF%BD%9C%E9%99%B3%E5%8A%9B%E6%96%B0%20%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A3%E3%83%BB%E8%90%AC%E8%8F%AF%20%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E5%8F%83%E9%81%B8%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%A1%E9%BB%A8%E7%84%A1%E6%B4%BE%E3%80%81%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%B6%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E7%8D%BB%E9%87%91%E3%80%82&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lishin.taipei" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-