text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:var(--brand)">加入志工</span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" data-drift="true" data-split="true" class="font-display mt-2 block text-[clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.6rem)] font-semibold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-tight" style="color:var(--brand)">Join Us</span><h2 data-split="true" class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-xl font-bold leading-snug sm:text-2xl" style="color:var(--ink)">留個聯絡方式，投票日見</h2></div><div class="reveal "><p class="mt-7 max-w-md text-base leading-[1.9] text-ink-soft sm:text-lg">30 秒、不需任何費用，力新絕不對外募款。留下聯絡方式，我們會在重要時刻邀你一起出力。</p></div><div class="reveal "><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><li class="rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">30 秒</li><li class="rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">不需任何費用</li><li class="rounded-full bg-brand-soft px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand">絕不對外募款</li></ul></div></div><div class="reveal "><div class="rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-cream p-6 sm:p-8"><form class="flex flex-col gap-6" noValidate=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><label for="vol-name" class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">你的稱呼<span class="text-brand"> *</span></label><input id="vol-name" type="text" required="" maxLength="80" class="w-full rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-ink focus:border-brand outline-none" value=""/></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><label for="vol-contact" class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">LINE ID 或 Email<span class="text-brand"> *</span></label><input id="vol-contact" type="text" required="" maxLength="200" placeholder="LINE ID 或 Email" class="w-full rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-ink focus:border-brand outline-none" value=""/></div><fieldset class="flex flex-col gap-2"><legend class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">你住在哪一區？</legend><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="district" value="中正區"/>中正區</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="district" value="萬華區"/>萬華區</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="radio" class="sr-only" name="district" value="其他（仍可幫忙分享）"/>其他（仍可幫忙分享）</label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="flex flex-col gap-2"><legend class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">想怎麼幫忙？（可複選）</legend><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" name="help" value="分享理念"/>分享理念</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" name="help" value="掃街/拜票"/>掃街/拜票</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" name="help" value="看板/貼紙"/>看板/貼紙</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" name="help" value="線上小編"/>線上小編</label><label class="cursor-pointer rounded-[10px] border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-brand"><input type="checkbox" class="sr-only" name="help" value="活動志工"/>活動志工</label></div></fieldset><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"><a class="font-bold text-brand underline underline-offset-2" href="/privacy">隱私權</a> · <!-- -->送出即表示你已閱讀隱私權告知，並同意團隊依所述目的處理這次提供的資料。</p><button type="submit" data-ga-event="generate_lead" class="w-full rounded-[10px] bg-brand px-7 py-4 font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-deep disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60">送出，加入力新</button></form></div></div></div></section><div class="container-x pb-8"><p class="mt-4 text-sm opacity-75">內容更新：<time dateTime="2026-10-09T03:22:19.675Z">2026年10月9日</time></p></div></main><footer class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand text-white"><div aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="1.4" class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-6 left-0 right-0 select-none text-center text-[26vw] font-black leading-none text-white/[0.06] sm:text-[20vw]">新力量</div><div class="container-x relative z-10 py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]"><div><img alt="陳力新" loading="lazy" width="3009" height="1398" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-12 w-auto" style="color:transparent" sizes="104px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ffa99cdc6748aa544492b291f50f3483546969cdf-3009x1398.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ffa99cdc6748aa544492b291f50f3483546969cdf-3009x1398.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ffa99cdc6748aa544492b291f50f3483546969cdf-3009x1398.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ffa99cdc6748aa544492b291f50f3483546969cdf-3009x1398.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ffa99cdc6748aa544492b291f50f3483546969cdf-3009x1398.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fh51j8cya%2Fproduction%2Ffa99cdc6748aa544492b291f50f3483546969cdf-3009x1398.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/ima