,\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\",\"children\":\"把 AI 與數位工具帶進地方治理，從停車、長照到觀光導覽逐項盤點在地需求，讓萬華老街區保有濃濃人情味，也能更聰明、更便利地運作。\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"讓長輩安心、年輕人願意留下\",{\"className\":\"reveal \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative border-t-2 border-brand/15 pt-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display block text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-brand/20\",\"children\":\"02\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-ink\",\"children\":\"讓長輩安心、年輕人願意留下\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\",\"children\":\"宜居不是口號，而是每天的生活細節。推動更友善的步行環境、社區照顧與公共空間，讓長輩在熟悉的巷弄裡安心生活，也讓年輕世代願意把根留在萬華、留在中正。\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"把世界帶進來，把萬華帶出去\",{\"className\":\"reveal \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative border-t-2 border-brand/15 pt-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display block text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-brand/20\",\"children\":\"03\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-ink\",\"children\":\"把世界帶進來，把萬華帶出去\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\",\"children\":\"我曾在海外創業、經營國際企業，深知連結的價值。推動在地與國際接軌，讓萬華的文化、店家與青年被更多人看見，也讓世界的好經驗在這片土地上慢慢落地。\"}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"reveal \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif-tc mt-16 flex items-start gap-3 text-2xl font-black leading-snug text-brand sm:text-3xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"mt-1.5 h-6 w-6 shrink-0 text-accent\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M12 0c.6 6.3 5.7 11.4 12 12-6.3.6-11.4 5.7-12 12-.6-6.3-5.7-11.4-12-12C6.3 11.4 11.4 6.3 12 0Z\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"城市需要新力量，而這股新力量，就從萬華這片我們共同的土地開始。\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"32:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"ideas\",\"cl